WEBVTT

00:00:06.192 --> 00:00:08.712
(PANTING) Wh... Doesn't he realize
that I'm not there?

00:00:09.032 --> 00:00:12.352
(LOUD GASP) I'm lost!

00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:15.752
(SOBS) Oh, I'm a lost toy!

00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:19.792
(SNIFFLING, SOBBING)

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:22.392
Buzz Lightyear mission log.

00:00:22.432 --> 00:00:25.792
The local sheriff and I seem to be at
a huge refueling station of some sort.

00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:27.112
You!

00:00:27.232 --> 00:00:28.472
(TRUCK APPROACHING,
HORN HONKING)

00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:37.232
(BRAKES SQUEALING)

00:00:39.952 --> 00:00:42.032
(ENGINE IDLING)

00:00:48.032 --> 00:00:50.312
-According to my navi-computer, the...
-(GASPS) Shut up!

00:00:50.392 --> 00:00:53.752
-Just shut up, you idiot!
-Sheriff, this is no time to panic.

00:00:53.792 --> 00:00:57.312
This is the perfect time to panic.
I'm lost. Andy is gone.

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:59.672
They're gonna move from their house
in two days, and it's all your fault!

00:00:59.752 --> 00:01:02.872
My... My fault? If you hadn't pushed me
out of the window in the first place...

00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:04.032
Oh, yeah?

00:01:04.072 --> 00:01:07.272
Well, if you hadn't shown up in your
stupid little cardboard spaceship

00:01:07.312 --> 00:01:09.312
and taken away everything
that was important to me...

00:01:09.392 --> 00:01:10.912
Don't talk to me
about importance!

00:01:10.952 --> 00:01:13.992
Because of you the security
of this entire universe is in jeopardy!

00:01:14.072 --> 00:01:16.592
What? What are
you talkin' about?

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:19.312
Right now, poised at
the edge of the galaxy, Emperor Zurg

00:01:19.392 --> 00:01:21.032
has been secretly building
a weapon

00:01:21.112 --> 00:01:24.432
with the destructive capacity
to annihilate an entire planet!

00:01:24.472 --> 00:01:28.752
I alone have information that reveals
this weapon's only weakness.

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:31.032
And you, my friend,
are responsible

00:01:31.112 --> 00:01:34.432
for delaying my rendezvous
with Star Command!

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:38.112
You... are... a... toy!

00:01:38.152 --> 00:01:40.392
You aren't the real
Buzz Lightyear! You're a...

00:01:40.472 --> 00:01:45.272
You're an action figure!
You are a child's plaything!

00:01:46.152 --> 00:01:49.952
You are a sad, strange little man,
and you have my pity.

00:01:49.992 --> 00:01:51.112
Farewell.

00:01:51.232 --> 00:01:54.312
Oh, yeah?
Well, good riddance, ya loony!

00:01:54.712 --> 00:01:57.592
-"Rendezvous with Star Command."
-(CAR APPROACHING)

00:01:58.152 --> 00:02:00.352
DRIVER: Hey, gas dude!
ATTENDANT: You talkin' to me?

00:02:00.432 --> 00:02:02.952
-Yeah, man. Can you help me?
-Pizza Planet? Andy!

00:02:02.992 --> 00:02:04.992
Do you know
where Cutting Boulevard is?

00:02:05.032 --> 00:02:06.392
Oh, no!

00:02:06.472 --> 00:02:09.352
I can't show my face
in that room without Buzz.

00:02:09.432 --> 00:02:12.352
-Buzz! Buzz, come back!
-Go away!

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.832
No! Buzz, you gotta
come back! I...

00:02:15.912 --> 00:02:20.072
-(ENGINE REVVING)
-I found a spaceship!

00:02:21.672 --> 00:02:23.832
It's a spaceship, Buzz!

00:02:25.472 --> 00:02:28.912
Come on, man, hurry up! Um, like,
the pizzas are getting cold here!

00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:32.632
-ATTENDANT: Cutting Boulevard, huh?
-Yeah, yeah. Which way?

00:02:32.672 --> 00:02:35.632
Now, you're sure this space freighter
will return to its port of origin

00:02:35.672 --> 00:02:38.112
-once it jettisons its food supply?
-Uh-huh.

00:02:38.192 --> 00:02:42.592
And when we get there, we'll be able
to find a way to transport you home.

00:02:42.672 --> 00:02:46.232
-Well, then, let's climb aboard.
-No, no, no, wait, Buzz! Buzz!

00:02:46.312 --> 00:02:48.352
Let's get in the back.
No one will see us there.

00:02:48.432 --> 00:02:51.672
Negative. There are no restraining
harnesses in the cargo area.

00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:53.992
-We'll be much safer in the cockpit.
-Yeah, bu...

00:02:54.512 --> 00:02:56.312
Buzz! Buzz!

00:02:56.352 --> 00:02:57.912
DRIVER: That's two lefts
and a right, huh?

00:02:57.992 --> 00:03:00.912
-Thanks for the directions, okay?
-Yeah. And remember, kid...

00:03:00.992 --> 00:03:03.352
-Buzz!
-(IGNITION STARTS)

00:03:08.952 --> 00:03:10.592
(SCREAMS)

00:03:14.872 --> 00:03:17.712
It's safer in the cockpit
than the cargo bay. What an idiot.

00:03:18.632 --> 00:03:21.232
-(TIRES SCREECH)
-(GRUNTS, GROANS)

00:03:21.272 --> 00:03:23.072
-(ROCK MUSIC PLAYS ON STEREO)
-(TIRES SQUEALING)

00:03:23.152 --> 00:03:25.552
(YELLING, GROANING)

00:03:30.592 --> 00:03:31.592
(SCREAMS)

00:03:34.512 --> 00:03:36.072
(CAR HORN HONKING)

00:03:40.232 --> 00:03:42.392
-(BRAKES SCREECH)
-(DOOR SIGNAL BUZZING)

00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:44.272
MAN ON PA: Next shuttle lift-off
is scheduled for

00:03:44.392 --> 00:03:47.752
-T-minus 30 minutes and counting.
-(JETS HUMMING)

00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:53.392
ROBOT: You are clear to enter.

00:03:53.432 --> 00:03:55.272
Welcome to Pizza Planet.

00:03:56.552 --> 00:03:59.032
WOMAN ON PA:
The white zone is for immediate pizza...

00:03:59.592 --> 00:04:01.592
-Sheriff!
-(GRUNTS, GROANS)

00:04:02.392 --> 00:04:03.792
There you are.

00:04:04.392 --> 00:04:07.152
Now, the entrance is heavily guarded.
We need a way to get inside.

00:04:07.272 --> 00:04:10.432
-(COUGHING)
-Great idea, Woody.

00:04:10.512 --> 00:04:12.632
I like your thinkin'.

00:04:13.432 --> 00:04:16.632
ROBOT: You are clear to enter.
Welcome to Pizza Planet.

00:04:16.752 --> 00:04:18.392
BUZZ: Now!

00:04:18.432 --> 00:04:21.272
Quickly, Sheriff!
The air lock is closing.

00:04:21.312 --> 00:04:24.032
WOMAN ON PA: Jones, party
of five, your shuttle is now boarding...

00:04:24.112 --> 00:04:26.072
BOY: Hey, Mom,
can we have some tokens?

00:04:26.472 --> 00:04:28.792
Ow! Watch where you're going!

00:04:28.832 --> 00:04:30.312
Sorry.

00:04:32.512 --> 00:04:34.432
(GROANS)

00:04:36.232 --> 00:04:40.512
MAN ON PA:
...nine, eight, seven, six,

00:04:40.592 --> 00:04:43.672
-five, four, three,
-(CHILDREN SHOUTING)

00:04:43.752 --> 00:04:45.752
two, one.

00:04:45.792 --> 00:04:49.352
What a spaceport!
Good work, Woody.

00:04:49.672 --> 00:04:51.992
(BEEPING, FIRES)

00:04:58.152 --> 00:05:00.992
Mom, can I play Black Hole?
Please, please, please?

00:05:01.072 --> 00:05:02.992
-Andy!
-Now, we need to find a ship

00:05:03.032 --> 00:05:06.512
-that's headed for Sector 12.
-Wait a minute. No, Buzz! This way.

00:05:06.552 --> 00:05:09.952
-There's a special ship. I just saw it.
-You mean it has hyperdrive?

00:05:10.592 --> 00:05:12.672
Hyperactive hyperdrive.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.592
-(CHATTERING)
-And Astro... turf!

00:05:15.672 --> 00:05:18.152
-Where is it? I-I don't see the...
-Come on. That's it.

00:05:18.272 --> 00:05:19.672
Spaceship!

00:05:21.512 --> 00:05:24.752
All right, Buzz, get ready.
And...

00:05:24.832 --> 00:05:26.632
-And the universe explodes!
-Okay, Buzz, when I say go,

00:05:26.672 --> 00:05:29.392
we're gonna jump in the basket.
Buzz!

00:05:31.632 --> 00:05:33.152
-(GRUNTS) No!
-ANDY: Mom, if I eat all my pizza,

00:05:33.192 --> 00:05:34.672
can I have some alien slime?

00:05:35.352 --> 00:05:37.432
This cannot be happening to me.

00:05:38.272 --> 00:05:39.512
(GASPS)

00:05:42.712 --> 00:05:44.712
(OBJECTS SQUEAKING)

00:05:46.992 --> 00:05:49.072
-A stranger.
-From the outside.

00:05:49.152 --> 00:05:53.552
-ALIENS TOGETHER: Ooh!
-Greetings. I am Buzz Lightyear.

00:05:53.632 --> 00:05:56.872
-I come in peace.
-(ALL GIBBERING)

00:05:58.992 --> 00:06:01.672
MAN ON PA: Before your
space journey, re-energize yourself

00:06:01.712 --> 00:06:05.352
with a slice of pepperoni,
now boarding at counter three.

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:08.312
BUZZ: This is an
intergalactic emergency.

00:06:08.392 --> 00:06:10.872
I need to commandeer
your vessel to Sector 12.

00:06:10.952 --> 00:06:13.352
Who's in charge here?

00:06:13.392 --> 00:06:16.232
ALIENS: The claw!

00:06:18.192 --> 00:06:19.512
The claw is our master.

00:06:19.552 --> 00:06:21.872
The claw chooses who will go
and who will stay.

00:06:21.912 --> 00:06:25.352
-This is ludicrous. (GASPS)
-Hey, bozo, you got a brain in there?

00:06:25.912 --> 00:06:28.392
-(LAUGHING) Take that!
-(BUZZING)

00:06:29.072 --> 00:06:31.232
Oh, no! Sid!

00:06:31.672 --> 00:06:32.912
-Get down!
-(GRUNTS)

00:06:35.232 --> 00:06:36.552
What's gotten into you? I was...

00:06:36.592 --> 00:06:38.832
You are the one that decided
to climb into this...

00:06:38.912 --> 00:06:41.352
Shh! The claw, it moves.

00:06:43.712 --> 00:06:45.752
(ALIENS SQUEAKING)

00:06:46.792 --> 00:06:48.192
(SQUEAKS)
I have been chosen!

00:06:48.912 --> 00:06:51.912
Farewell, my friends.
I go on to a better place.

00:06:52.472 --> 00:06:54.272
Gotcha!

00:06:56.072 --> 00:06:59.112
A Buzz Lightyear?
No way!

00:06:59.592 --> 00:07:02.032
-(COIN CLICKING)
-(ALIEN SQUEAKS)

00:07:02.112 --> 00:07:03.872
(SQUEAK)

00:07:06.032 --> 00:07:08.432
(GRUNTING)

00:07:08.592 --> 00:07:11.752
(CLAW BUZZING)

00:07:15.472 --> 00:07:17.032
-SID: Yes!
-(GASPS)

00:07:17.112 --> 00:07:18.952
Buzz! No! (GRUNTING)

00:07:20.552 --> 00:07:22.592
-Hey!
-(GRUNTING)

00:07:23.592 --> 00:07:25.232
-(GRUNTING)
-He has been chosen!

00:07:25.312 --> 00:07:26.952
-He must go.
-Hey!

00:07:27.032 --> 00:07:28.592
-What are you doing?
-Do not fight the claw.

00:07:28.632 --> 00:07:30.792
Stop it! Stop it, you zealots!

00:07:34.312 --> 00:07:37.112
All right!
Double prizes!

00:07:39.752 --> 00:07:42.352
Let's go home and... play.

00:07:42.472 --> 00:07:44.192
(SINISTER CHUCKLE)

